      "message": "I see this on PTL:\n```\n[    2.358529] pkvm: unmitigated cpu bug bhi\n[    2.359155] pkvm: in total has 1 unmitigated cpu bugs\n```\n\nand AFAICS the reason is not that X86_FEATURE_BHI_CTRL is not available (it is available, and BHI_DIS_S is set) but simply a logic error: this check for X86_FEATURE_BHI_CTRL succeeds and mitigate_spectre_v2() returns success, so we clear X86_BUG_SPECTRE_V2, but we still don\u0027t clear X86_BUG_BHI.\n\nDon\u0027t you see the same?",
