      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t see this when testing on PTL. After some investigation, now I understand the reason. In AL OS v6.12 kernel, it has some new backported patches form the upstream. The patch \"b86349f32625 x86/bpf: Add IBHF call at end of classic BPF\" will set the BHI bug flag to PTL cpu. The test from my side was performed on a PTL desktop, with the intel-staging v6.12 kernel on github, which doesn\u0027t this patch, thus didn\u0027t observe the same.\n\nI will update the intel-staging kernel with this patch, and fix this. Thanks for caching up this.",
